# UI/UX for BingeWatcher

Read `DESIGN.md` for the source of truth. When editing Vue/CSS:

## Must keep
- Fonts: Bebas Neue (display), Outfit (body) — never Inter/Roboto/system as primary
- Palette: ink / panel / gold / mist / paper / flare from `app/assets/css/main.css`
- Brand-first Discover hero: product name + one headline + short support + search — not a dashboard

## Patterns
- Genre chips: horizontal scroll, gold active state
- List detail: group by Watching / Want / Watched / Unsorted
- Poster `+` becomes check when title is already in any list
- Recommendations use the same `PosterCard` grid language

## Avoid
- Purple/indigo gradients, nested cards in hero, universe/franchise nav
- Generic AI SaaS look; bounce easings; gray text on colored backgrounds
- Surprising errors for “already added” — surface membership before submit
